What this repository contains, and who holds copyright in it
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is a fork of https://github.com/TrustTunnel/TrustTunnelClient.
It contains work by two parties, both released under the Apache License 2.0:

  * The C++ VPN core — the tunnel, the WinTUN adapter, route interception and the
    kill switch, shipped as the `trusttunnel_client` sidecar process, together
    with the protocol implementation it is built on.

        Copyright 2020 AdGuard Software Ltd

    Sources live on the `release/tt-win-3.0.0` branch and in the release tags.
    This fork carries local changes to that code; they are confined to the
    `trusttunnel/` directory.

  * The Windows desktop application — the `gui-pro/` and `gui-light/`
    directories, their Rust backends, and the supporting scripts. Written for
    this fork; there is no counterpart upstream.

        Copyright 2026 ialexbond

